# Judge2-9-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:わがはいを疑うのはいいが、<br>それらは全て<br>憶測によるものだ。|#0102Trial09_AnAn001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そもそもミリアの悲鳴が<br>スマホによって<br>再生された音声だという<br>証拠もない。|#0102Trial09_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:けど……<br>スマホのデータが<br>消えていたのは<br>真実ですわ！|#0102Trial09_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:わがはいが調べた時には<br>すでに消えていただけだ。|#0102Trial09_AnAn003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:犯人が消したのかもしれないし、<br>元からスマホが<br>壊れかけていたのかもしれない。<br>可能性はいくらでも考えられる。|#0102Trial09_AnAn004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それに……<br>音声を流すだけなら<br>アラームでも設定すればいい。<br>時間を指定すればいいなら、<br>犯人はその場にいなくても<br>可能だ。|#0102Trial09_AnAn005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかに……。<br>【時間指定の呼び出しメモ】も<br>あったし、<br>不可能じゃないのかも<br>しれないわね？|#0102Trial09_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でも不確実ですけどね～。<br>覗き窓から中を見ちゃったら、<br>ミリアさんが死んでるのは<br>バレちゃいますし。|#0102Trial09_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……そもそもそれも<br>おかしな話だ。|#0102Trial09_AnAn006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:仮にわがはいとハンナが<br>悲鳴を聞いたとき、<br>すでにミリアが<br>中で死んでいたとしよう。|#0102Trial09_AnAn007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だが、<br>中を覗き込めば<br>そんなものすぐに<br>バレてしまうのだ。|#0102Trial09_AnAn008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"中を覗いたら<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_09_01\">アリバイ</link>も何もない。<br>なのにわがはいが<br>そんな<link=\"Objection_01_02_09_02\">不確実な事</link>を<br>するわけがないだろう？<br>わがはいは<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_09_03\">偽装工作をする意味</link><br>などないのだ。|#0102Trial09_AnAn009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ナノカが中に入って<br>ミリアを殺害し、<br>そして密室工作を行った……。<br>そう考えれば<br>何も不自然なところはない。|#0102Trial09_AnAn010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR6,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"全てはナノカの周到な<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_09_04\">ミリア殺害計画</link><br>によるもの。<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_09_05\">動機</link>も十分、<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_09_06\">懲罰房の中に入って</link><br>もいる……。|#0102Trial09_AnAn011|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ナノカが犯人だというのは、<br>誰の目から見ても明らかだ！|#0102Trial09_AnAn012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……たしかに<br>私は疑わしいわ。|#0102Trial09_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Angry_Closed1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:けれど、<br>あなたの嫌疑が晴れたとは<br>言えない……。|#0102Trial09_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default,ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:おかしなところは<br>全て話してもらうわ。<br>……真実を明らかにする為に。|#0102Trial09_Nanoka003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

